  "scopeAndClaimLimits": [
    "Accepted ordinary R1 scores pool only within identical preload profile; groups/holes in a burst are correlated. Empirical nearest-rank p99 has no confidence interval/provider SLO.",
    "18/108 initial counts include all intent families. Qualification is immediate pending CALCUTTA/COMPETITION EXISTS, not automatic-only backlog depth.",
    "Live runner plus pending automatic demand does not prove the worker occupied CPU or SQL at every exact scoring instant.",
    "Timing includes test-only clocks and sampler overhead. Lower bracket ends before COMMIT; upper autocommit acknowledgement includes acquisition, wrapper, IPC and scheduling. Neither is exact lock-through-durable-COMMIT time.",
    "Raw evidence does not retain lastCommitAt. freshIdle.tickStartedAt>lastCommitAt is an executed source assertion, not independently re-evaluable from raw timestamps.",
    "Resource sampler excludes itself and observes approximately25ms-plus-query intervals. Sampled maxima cannot prove continuous maxima or absence of brief waits; pg_stat_activity/pg_locks observations need not be simultaneous.",
    "No CPU, memory, IOPS, connection-pool headroom, durable-fsync capacity, or matched worker-off overhead conclusion follows.",
    "Managed-family current pointer equality and fixed configuration/publication facts are verified; independent payout math is not established by this performance run.",
    "Net Skins WAITING_OWNER and FinalRecap WAITING_PUBLICATION are explicit nonautomatic authority states.",
    "The tick and convergence oracle do not cover Google reporting outbox or external archive delivery. No all-work idle, external financial safety, P0-B closure or staging readiness is claimed.",
